{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56721","headline":"罗浮山 二 · 无名氏","name":"罗浮山 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉殿朝元夜已深，二舌世界静沉沉。\n霏微紫气通蓬岛，浩荡江风下宝林。\n云彩散爲天上绮，日华浮动水中金。\n步虚声断一回首，十二楼台何处寻。\n（见康熙乙酉刊李嗣珏纂《罗浮山志》卷一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}